<headroom-library version="1" id="gm-locked-groove" category="Guitar + MIDI" order="70" instrument="guitar" style="Hybrid Electro Rock">
  <description>Hold a chord: a glassy synth arpeggiates it in sixteenths, is driven with the guitar into a distortion and a bright blackface 2x12, and then a trance gate chops the whole fused signal on the same clock. Guitar and arp lock into one sequenced machine at the rig tempo. Gate sets how hard the chop is.</description>
  <tags><tag>Guitar + MIDI</tag><tag>Fused</tag><tag>Crunch</tag><tag>Arpeggiator</tag><tag>Trance Gate</tag><tag>Synth</tag><tag>Rhythm</tag><tag>Poly</tag></tags>
  <sources>
    <source url="https://www.premierguitar.com/videos/rig-rundown/muse" title="Premier Guitar: Rig Rundown, Muse (Kaoss Pad synth textures blended with the guitar)"/>
    <source url="https://blog.andertons.co.uk/sound-like/sound-like-sleep-token-guitars-bass-synths-samplers-vocals" title="Andertons: sound like Sleep Token (synth pads and orchestral layers under baritone guitars)"/>
  </sources>
</headroom-library>
</headroom-preset>
